# Firebender Ascension counts a creature you control attacking causing a triggered ability *of that creature* to trigger. Turn 1 Bot1 casts
# the Ascension (its Soldier token) and Akrasan Squire. Turn 3 the Soldier attacks alone, which causes two abilities to trigger: its own
# firebending, and the Squire's exalted, which belongs to the Squire and not to the attacker. One quest counter, not two.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Firebender Ascension
Akrasan Squire
Mountain
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Firebender Ascension.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Akrasan Squire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Soldier Token > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Firebender Ascension.Counters.Quest = 1
